<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE V INDIA ONE-DAY SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE V INDIA ONE-DAY SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>BENONI, South Africa 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard of the</p>
<p>one-day triangular series match between Zimbabwe and India at</p>
<p>Willowmore Park on Sunday:</p>
